s2 fold wr64 c1 s1 7760 ri
st call hashis s2 p2 43
bp0 and b0 pro
bp and bp0 st
c2 select bp 1 0
s3 fold wr64 c2 s2 7761 1
n0 and a0 isnum
nm and n0 mc
ints call num s3 1
c3 select nm 1 0
s4 fold wr64 c3 s3 7762 ints
ba0 and a0 istrue
ba and ba0 acc
c4 select ba 1 0
s5 fold wr64 c4 s4 7766 1
e0 and tr d4
e1 and e0 isnum
e2 call kis s5 3 p2 24
e3 and e1 e2
lp call kis s5 4 p2 25
wp call kis s5 4 p2 26
tc call kis s5 4 p2 27
ou call kis s5 4 p2 28
pp or lp wp
x1 and e3 pp
c5 select x1 1 0
s6 fold addw c5 s5 7763 ints
x2 and e3 tc
c6 select x2 1 0
s7 fold addw c6 s6 7764 ints
x3 and e3 ou
c7 select x3 1 0
s8 fold addw c7 s7 7765 ints
# the end of a trial: add it to its representation when structured
cl0 eq t 9
cl1 and cl0 d3
cl and cl1 tr
r0 call g s8 7760
sr call g s8 7761
okr lt r0 nr
oks eq sr 1
ok0 and okr oks
ok and ok0 cl
cc select ok 6 0
slot call g s8 14
sl8 shl slot 3
slr add sl8 r0
sl6 mul slr 6
base add sl6 6800
s9 fold celladd cc s8 base
ret s9
end

